WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:03.838
This clinical study measured circulating ACE two

00:00:03.838 --> 00:00:07.026
and angiotensin two in two hundred hypertensive

00:00:07.026 --> 00:00:10.214
patients with COVID nineteen. It is an

00:00:10.214 --> 00:00:12.947
observational analysis, not a treatment trial.

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:18.958
The original dot plots compare circulating ACE

00:00:18.958 --> 00:00:22.265
two and angiotensin two across mild, moderate,

00:00:22.265 --> 00:00:25.573
and severe illness, with the authors' reported

00:00:25.573 --> 00:00:26.518
confidence intervals.

00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:33.468
The reported soluble ACE two level was

00:00:33.468 --> 00:00:36.286
about one point nine times higher in

00:00:36.286 --> 00:00:39.105
severe disease than in mild cases. This

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:41.923
does not establish the direction of causation.

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:49.315
The researchers compared patients taking ACE inhibitors,

00:00:49.315 --> 00:00:52.980
angiotensin receptor blockers, beta blockers, and calcium

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:56.644
channel blockers. These were recorded exposures, not

00:00:56.644 --> 00:00:58.215
randomly assigned drugs.

00:01:00.650 --> 00:01:04.015
The original figure shows variation between medication

00:01:04.015 --> 00:01:07.380
groups in circulating ACE two and angiotensin

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:10.745
two. These are blood assays, not direct

00:01:10.745 --> 00:01:13.149
measurements of membrane receptor expression.

00:01:15.650 --> 00:01:18.774
The third figure separates medication classes by

00:01:18.774 --> 00:01:21.898
disease severity. It reports treatment group associations

00:01:21.898 --> 00:01:25.022
within an already ill population, not clinical

00:01:25.022 --> 00:01:27.253
benefit from starting a drug.

00:01:30.650 --> 00:01:33.990
Medication choice, baseline cardiovascular disease, age, and

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:37.330
illness severity can all shape the observed

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:40.671
associations. The study cannot resolve all of

00:01:40.671 --> 00:01:41.625
those differences.

00:01:45.650 --> 00:01:48.810
The contribution is a clinical biochemical observation

00:01:48.810 --> 00:01:51.970
linking treatment context, soluble ACE two, and

00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:55.129
angiotensin two. It does not tell a

00:01:55.129 --> 00:01:56.935
patient to change medication.
